_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p004","quote":"弘為人恢奇多聞，常稱以為人主病不廣大，人臣病不儉節。弘為布被，食不重肉。后母死，服喪三年。每朝會議，開陳其端，令人主自擇，不肯面折庭爭。於是天子察其行敦厚，辯論有餘，習文法吏事，而又緣飾以儒術，上大說之。二歲中，至左內史。弘奏事，有不可，不庭辯之。嘗與主爵都尉汲黯請閒，汲黯先發之，弘推其後，天子常說，所言皆聽，以此日益親貴。嘗與公卿約議，至上前，皆倍其約以順上旨。汲黯庭詰弘曰：「齊人多詐而無情實，始與臣等建此議，今皆倍之，不忠。」上問弘。弘謝曰：「夫知臣者以臣為忠，不知臣者以臣為不忠。」上然弘言。左右幸臣每毀弘，上益厚遇之。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m004-0036"}],"interpretation_note":"后母死明記死亡，服喪三年不反推卒年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m001-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"後母","kind":"person","person_id":"fyw_e6a_8dl","status":"source_explicit","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m004-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"后母","kind":"person","person_id":"fyw_e6a_8dl","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji112-001","subject_person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","predicate":"stepmother","object_person_id":"fyw_e6a_8dl","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p001","quote":"丞相公孫弘者，齊菑川國薛縣人也，字季。少時為薛獄吏，有罪，免。家貧，牧豕海上。年四十餘，乃學春秋雜說。養後母孝謹。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"後母"},"interpretation_note":"明示後母，不記生母或自動補父親婚姻。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p001","text":"丞相公孫弘者，齊菑川國薛縣人也，字季。少時為薛獄吏，有罪，免。家貧，牧豕海上。年四十餘，乃學春秋雜說。養後母孝謹。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m001-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_i